{"step_index":336,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T00:12:24Z","thinking":"The code iterates through search queries, parsing results to find candidate business numbers. It filters for unique business numbers and collects them until five are found. It then retrieves detailed information for each candidate and discards those that lack detail.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"manage_task","args":{"Action":"kill","TaskId":"cc5f8116-f40f-4d66-a990-d85efe7bc64f/task-300","toolAction":"Stopping slow task-300","toolSummary":"Kill task-300"}}]}
